OL,3,AThe seven Anthropic founders who are
OL,4,Aabout to become multi-billionaires
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the space of just five years,
OL,7,FAnthropic has gone from unknown
OL,8,Fstart-up to tech giant, worth more than
OL,9,Fa trillion dollars.
OL,11,FThe company behind the AI platform
OL,12,FClaude was formed by seven people who
OL,13,Fleft rival OpenAI in 2021 and, in a
OL,14,Fmatter of hours, will become
OL,15,Fmulti-billionaires - on paper at least.
OL,17,FAnthropic is floating the business on
OL,18,Fthe US stock exchange and will sell its
OL,19,Fshares at between $70 - $78 each.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/17
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
