OL,3,AThe seven Anthropic founders who are
OL,4,Aabout to become multi-billionaires
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf they go for the highest price, the
OL,7,Ffounders' shareholdings will be worth
OL,8,Fat least $18.5bn each.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/17
