OL,3,AHacks, AI or just overdue updates - why
OL,4,Ahave there been so many outages?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOutages and IT failings are commonplace
OL,7,F- but not on this scale.
OL,9,FIn the past week, there has been a
OL,10,Fmassive Microsoft outage, an apparent
OL,11,Ftech glitch which grounded all US
OL,12,Fflights for hours, and issues for the
OL,13,FNational Security Agency (NSA). That's
OL,14,Fnot to mention outages affecting the
OL,15,Fbiggest US banks, as well as a major
OL,16,Fflaw found in a popular programming
OL,17,Flanguage.
OL,19,FThese are all separate incidents - but
OL,20,Fthe fact they have all come so close to
OL,21,Feach other has got people wondering if
OL,22,Fthey might be linked.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/17
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11907
SC,0007
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1795036709
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AHacks, AI or just overdue updates - why
OL,4,Ahave there been so many outages?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is no evidence to suggest this -
OL,7,Fbut they do tell us a lot about how the
OL,8,Fmodern tech world works, and where the
OL,9,Fvulnerabilities lie.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/17
