OL,3,AHarry Styles, Billie Eilish, Sam Fender
OL,4,Aand Cher to headline Glastonbury 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarry Styles will make his Glastonbury
OL,7,Ffestival debut next year as one of the
OL,8,Fevent's headliners, alongside Sam
OL,9,FFender and Billie Eilish - with Cher
OL,10,Famong the other stars on the bill.
OL,12,FThe veteran US pop icon will play the
OL,13,Fcoveted Sunday afternoon "legends"
OL,14,Fslot, which is often considered a
OL,15,Ffourth headline set. It will be her
OL,16,Fonly UK festival appearance of the
OL,17,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/17
